 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   Input: A 3D volumetric dataset (density field) and a set of rays.
-*   Output: Rendered image or accumulated density/transmittance.
-*   Auxiliary: A preprocessed Volume Occupancy Map (binary mask).
